SUMMARY:Classic Albums Live: Led Zeppelin IV at Miller Outdoor Theatre
DTSTAMP:20260822T032655Z
DTSTART:20260828T200000Z
DESCRIPTION:Miller Outdoor Theatre welcomes Classic Albums Live back to the
	 Hermann Park stage for a live concert recreating Led Zeppelin IV—an incre
	dible album featuring some of Led Zeppelin’s most beloved and recognizable
	 recordings—note for note and cut for cut under the stars. \nAudiences can
	 sing along with favorites like as “Rock and Roll”\, “When the Levee Break
	s”\, and of course\, “Stairway to Heaven”. \nConsidered one of the greates
	t albums of all time\, Led Zeppelin IV is an album full of experimentation
	 from the way it was recorded to the variety of arrangements. As the best-
	selling album of one of the best-selling bands\, it sold 37 million+ copie
	s worldwide. \nThis performance was originally scheduled to showcase The E
	agles’ Hotel California. \nFinding Your Seat at Miller Outdoor Theatre \nA
	s always\, all seats at Miller are free\, but covered seating for popular 
	evening shows usually requires a free assigned ticket reserved 24 hours in
	 advance. \nLearn more about getting free seated tickets at Miller. \nAdmi
	ssion\nFree. Learn more or reserve a free seated ticket. \n \nThis Feature
	d Calendar Listing was sponsored by the event organizer and boosted in our
	 calendar with images and more details.  \nLearn more about promoting your
	 event\, organization\, business\, or offer across all of our channels.\n\
	nhttps://365thingsinhouston.com/calendar/classic-albums-live-led-zeppelin-
	iv-at-miller-outdoor-theatre/\n\nFrom 365 Things to Do in Houston
URL:https://365thingsinhouston.com/calendar/classic-albums-live-led-zeppeli
	n-iv-at-miller-outdoor-theatre/
LOCATION:Miller Outdoor Theatre\, 6000 Hermann Park Dr\, Houston\, TX\, 770
	30\, United States
