SUMMARY:The Lighthouse Open House 2026
DTSTAMP:20260822T032655Z
DTSTART:20260911T130000Z
DESCRIPTION:Join Us at The Lighthouse Open House 2026 for People who are Bl
	ind\, Low Vision\, or have a Disability! \nDate & Time:Friday\, September 
	11\, 20261 – 3:30 PM \nLocation:The Lighthouse of Houston3602 West Dallas 
	St\, Houston\, TX 77019 \nEvent Description:Join us for the inaugural Ligh
	thouse Open House 2026\, a dynamic and inclusive event designed for people
	 who are blind\, have low vision\, or live with a disability. This one-day
	 event will feature hands-on experiences\, valuable resources\, and commun
	ity connection opportunities all under one roof. \nEvent Highlights:Employ
	ment \n\nResume-building workshops and interview prep\nMeet-and-greet with
	 inclusive employers\nTips for navigating the workplace with vision loss\n
	\nTechnology \n\nHands-on demonstrations of assistive technology and low v
	ision devices\nTutorials on screen readers\, magnifiers\, and accessible a
	pps\nTry-before-you-buy opportunities with top vendors\n\nHealth & Communi
	ty Resources \n\nFree health screenings (blood pressure\, glucose\, and mo
	re)\nBehavioral health and wellness sessions\nDiabetes education and visio
	n-specific health tips\nInformation on transportation\, housing\, and bene
	fits assistance\nAccess to local nonprofits\, support organizations\, and 
	accessible recreation\n\nWhether you’re seeking tools for independence\, l
	ooking to connect with community services\, or exploring inclusive employm
	ent\, this expo is for you. \nClick Here for Attendee Registration. \nClic
	k Here for Vendor Registration.\n\nhttps://houstonlighthouse.org/event/the
	-lighthouse-expo-2026/\n\nFrom Houston Lighthouse
URL:https://houstonlighthouse.org/event/the-lighthouse-expo-2026/
LOCATION:The Lighthouse of Houston\, 3602 West Dallas\, Houston\, TX\, 7701
	9\, United States
X-CALRIPPER-SOURCE:houston-lighthouse
CATEGORIES:Houston Lighthouse
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
DURATION:PT3H
END:VEVENT
