IMAGE;VALUE=URI;DISPLAY=BADGE;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://hermannpark.org/wp
 -content/uploads/2026/07/HP_PTP_2025_Digital_1080x1080-e1784305129178.jpg
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://hermannpark.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/0
 7/HP_PTP_2025_Digital_1080x1080-e1784305129178.jpg
UID:0yihW-cY3oaag8PGgIbXK
SUMMARY:Park to Port Bike Ride
DTSTAMP:20260822T032656Z
DTSTART:20261024T080000Z
DESCRIPTION:Hermann Park Conservancy’s 12th annual Park to Port Bike Ride\,
	 presented by Port Houston\, is set for Saturday\, October 24. \nThe 20-mi
	le round-trip bike ride takes cyclists from Hermann Park’s Bayou Parkland 
	along the Bayou Greenway trail all the way to Mason Park\, near the Port o
	f Houston. Enjoy the turn-around party\, but be sure to save some energy f
	or a well-deserved post-ride party under the Bill Coats Bridge! \nPark to 
	Port is open to riders of all skill levels and is not a race. Whether you 
	are an experienced cyclist or are riding just for fun\, you can go at your
	 own pace on this scenic city journey. \nYour participation in Park to Por
	t supports Hermann Park Conservancy and its stewardship efforts for one of
	 Houston’s most beloved parks while promoting the ever-growing Bayou Green
	way trail system. \nRegister and learn more at the following link: 12th An
	nual Park to Port Bike Ride. Early bird pricing is available until August 
	17. \nSPECIAL OFFER: Save $10 on registration when you sign up for BOTH th
	e Park to Port Bike Ride and Run in the Park! Bundle deal is available via
	 the link above. Information on Run in the Park can be found here.\n\nhttp
	s://hermannpark.org/event/park-to-port-bike-ride-2/\n\nFrom Hermann Park C
	onservancy
URL:https://hermannpark.org/event/park-to-port-bike-ride-2/
LOCATION:Bayou Parkland\, 6532 Almeda Rd\, Houston\, TX\, 77021\, United St
	ates
X-CALRIPPER-SOURCE:hermann-park
CATEGORIES:Hermann Park Conservancy
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
DURATION:PT3H
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
IMAGE;VALUE=URI;DISPLAY=BADGE;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://ccs-houston.com/wp-
