SUMMARY:CCS $20\,000 cEDH Invitational Qualifier #5
DTSTAMP:20260822T032656Z
DTSTART:20261024T100000Z
DESCRIPTION:🏆 CCS $20\,000 cEDH Invitational Qualifier #5 🏆\nThe penultimat
	e weekend in the series is here in Houston. \nThe near-last stop in the CC
	S $50\,000 cEDH Invitational Series! Time to earn leaderboard points\, loc
	k in your invite\, and secure your seat at the 128-player Invitational is 
	running out…not to mention your claim to the $20\,000 prize pool. \nFull D
	etails → https://topdeck.gg/event/ccs-50000-cedh-invitational \n  \n🗓 Octo
	ber 24–25\, 2026 | Registration Opens at 9AM \n📍 9700 Bissonett St Unit 15
	00\, Houston\, TX 77036 \n  \nTournament Details:\n\n🎟️ Entry Fee: $90 befo
	re Oct 10\, $110 After\n🔗 Register Now! 👉 https://topdeck.gg/event/css-200
	00-cedh-invitational-qualifier-6\n\n  \n🗂️ Format & Structure\n\nFormat: cE
	DH (Proxy Friendly)\nSaturday: 6 Swiss Rounds (based on attendance)\nSunda
	y: 2 Swiss Rounds → Top 16\n\n  \n🚫 Proxy Requirements:\n\nFull card name\
	, mana cost\, type line\, and effect text\nTest cards or clearly written M
	DFCs allowed\nNo paper slip-ins permitted\n\n  \n💰 Guaranteed $20\,000 Pri
	ze Pool\n\n1st — $5\,000 + Auto Invite + TopDeck Invite + 200 pts\n2nd-4th
	 — $2\,000 each + Auto Invite + 160 pts\n5th–8th — $550 + 120 pts\n9th–16t
	h — $550 + 100 pts\n17th–32nd — $175 + 75 pts\n33rd–48th — 60 pts\n49th–64
	th — 45 pts\n65th–96th — 30 pts\n97th–128th — 20 pts\n\n  \nEvent Schedule
	:\n🕔 Registration Opens: 9 AM \n🕔 Player Meeting (Day 1): 10 AM \n🕔 Day 2 
	Start Time: 9 AM \n  \n🛍️ Collectible Marketplace\nBetween rounds\, enjoy a
	ccess to a curated marketplace featuring: \n\nTCG singles\, sealed\, and a
	ccessories\nRetro video games & consoles\nAnime merch\, figures\, and mode
	ls\nToys and other hobby collectibles\n\nPerfect for grabbing upgrades\, b
	rowsing grails\, or just hanging out between matches. \n  \n🏨 Special Hote
	l Deals\nEnjoy a special rate of $79/night — 2 Queens at TownePlace Suites
	\, only 15 minutes away from the action! \nBook your stay 👉🏻 https://tinyur
	l.com/CCSHoustonHotel \n  \n🔔 IMPORTANT REMINDERS\n\nPlayer names will app
	ear as real names on published documents.\nTop 16 decklists will be publis
	hed.\n\nhttps://ccs-houston.com/events/ccs-20000-cedh-invitational-qualifi
	er-5/\n\nFrom CCS Houston
URL:https://ccs-houston.com/events/ccs-20000-cedh-invitational-qualifier-5/
X-CALRIPPER-SOURCE:ccs-houston
CATEGORIES:CCS Houston
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
DURATION:PT31H
END:VEVENT
