 /HP_RITP_2026_Logo_BG-scaled-e1784308702643.png
UID:XGDW1vB2Jz9fZ_VAM2lOo
SUMMARY:Run in the Park
DTSTAMP:20260822T032656Z
DTSTART:20261114T080000Z
DESCRIPTION:Hermann Park Conservancy’s Run in the Park will return on Satur
	day\, November 14.\n\nParticipants will be able to run\, or walk\, to supp
	ort the conservation efforts of the Conservancy. All proceeds from Run in 
	the Park go towards the crucial work needed to maintain Hermann Park and i
	ts trail system.\n\nWith 5K and 10K routes\, as well as a 1K kids’ route f
	or the in-person event\, exercise enthusiasts of all ages and abilities ca
	n come to explore the Park and enjoy the shaded trails enjoyed by millions
	 of visitors per year. The event starts and ends at the Molly Ann Smith Pl
	aza\, near the Jones Reflection Pool\, and includes a post-run party with 
	food\, drinks\, music\, and more!\n\nThe Conservancy also offers an at-hom
	e\, virtual option. You can support Hermann Park at your own pace\, from t
	he comfort of your own neighborhood! Virtual registrants will still get th
	e exclusive Run in the Park t-shirt and access to an online leaderboard.\n
	\n\nRegister and learn more at the following link: 23rd Annual Run in the 
	Park. Early bird pricing is available until August 14. \n\nSPECIAL OFFER: 
	Save $10 on registration when you sign up for BOTH the Park to Port Bike R
	ide and Run in the Park! Bundle deal is available via the link above. Info
	rmation on Run in the Park can be found here.\n\nhttps://hermannpark.org/e
	vent/run-in-the-park-3/\n\nFrom Hermann Park Conservancy
URL:https://hermannpark.org/event/run-in-the-park-3/
LOCATION:Molly Ann Smith Plaza\, Hermann Park\, Houston\, TX\, 77004\, Unit
	ed States
X-CALRIPPER-SOURCE:hermann-park
CATEGORIES:Hermann Park Conservancy
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
DURATION:PT3H
END:VEVENT
